; The outer loop reaches the pipeliner already converted to a JNZD hardware
; loop: start.loop.iterations in the preheader, a counter PHI in the header and
; loop.decrement.reg in the latch, with no induction variable left. The
; pipeliner keeps that hardware loop as it is.

; Peeling the last iteration lowers the trip count operand of
; start.loop.iterations instead of a latch limit, and the peeled copy carries
; no decrement.
